<title>AUSTRIA: ALPINE SKIING-MEN'S DOWNHILL FIRST-RUN TIMES.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-MEN'S DOWNHILL FIRST-RUN TIMES.</headline>
<dateline>KITZBUEHEL, Austria 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading first- leg</p>
<p>times in a men's Alpine skiing World Cup two-run downhill on</p>
<p>Friday:</p>
<p>1. Luc Alphand (France) one minute 06.26 seconds</p>
<p>2. Werner Franz (Austria) 1:06.33</p>
<p>3. equal. Franco Cavegn (Switzerland) 1:06.45</p>
<p>3. equal. Werner Perathoner (Italy) 1:06.45</p>
<p>5. Atle Skaardal (Norway) 1:06.56</p>
<p>6. Josef Strobl (Austria) 1:06.57</p>
<p>7. Roland Assinger (Austria) 1:06.67</p>
<p>8. William Besse (Switzerland) 1:06.73</p>
<p>9. Pietro Vitalini (Italy) 1:06.81</p>
<p>10. Cary Mullen (Canada) 1:06.88</p>
</text>
